WEBVTT

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:13.950
You've made it through
five days of intense training!

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.200
Be proud of yourselves.
You are powerful indeed!

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:20.700
And as a small gesture of recognition

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.960
for both your growth and the end of camp,

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:27.070
I'd like to welcome you all to our after-party.

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:28.960
Now, go enjoy yourselves!

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:32.680
Cheers!

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:44.560
Are you all right, Ash?

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:48.840
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:52.030
That healing magic really did the trick.

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:56.830
<i>I bet they saw right through that one.</i>

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:00.660
<i>Still...</i>

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:04.210
Gawain is...

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:06.290
Gawain is gone?

00:01:07.220 --> 00:01:08.680
But where could he be?

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:09.860
I don't know.

00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:12.670
With our astral flow interrupted...

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:15.660
The Willingham Mausoleum.

00:01:17.630 --> 00:01:21.430
Have you heard the old story about the Willingham Mausoleum?

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:24.560
Well, I've heard of it.

00:01:25.670 --> 00:01:31.190
It's about the young Maestro Nuada and the girl who was his master.

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:36.820
Pained at seeing his master
suffering from a grave illness,

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:42.180
Nuada closed off their
astral flow and vanished.

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:48.570
He didn't want her to see him
waste away and perish.

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:53.760
At long last, the girl recovered...

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:57.500
but only after Nuada
had quietly expired,

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:02.270
inside the Willingham
Mausoleum, all alone.

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:08.300
Gawain couldn't be trying
to pull a Nuada, could he?

00:02:08.870 --> 00:02:10.520
It's possible.

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:15.530
The mausoleum is a resting
place for young dragons,

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:17.530
and Gawain is still a juvenile.

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:22.090
All right. We'll call off the celebration and organize a search party.

00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:25.080
If we scour the area around
the Willingham Mausoleum...

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:26.230
Wait.

00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:30.340
Camp was pretty grueling, wasn't it?

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:33.290
Everyone's been looking
forward to this party.

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:37.290
Okay. Then just the
Student Council members.

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:39.440
No, that won't work either.

00:02:40.490 --> 00:02:42.800
If the whole Student Council is absent,

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:45.500
everyone will know something's up.

00:02:45.990 --> 00:02:47.560
So much for the celebration.

00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:49.210
Then...

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:50.390
It's all right.

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:53.950
I'll handle this.

00:02:58.240 --> 00:02:59.950
<i>And you can bet I'll find you...</i>

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:01.420
<i>Gawain!</i>

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:10.580
The princess approaches.

00:03:14.470 --> 00:03:18.090
Ashes to ashes, dust to dust.

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:21.430
Come forth, promised
child of magica-technica!

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:06.090
So Gawain's in there?

00:05:06.090 --> 00:05:07.740
Hard to say.

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:13.200
But we've received intel that
Professor Angela is holed up inside.

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:15.470
What's <i>she</i> doing here?

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:18.420
What is it?!

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:22.000
Look!

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:36.060
This sense of foreboding
is just like before.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:37.560
I'm sure of it!

00:06:00.370 --> 00:06:01.510
Look at that!

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:04.130
What <i>are</i> they?

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:07.180
They're in the lake too!

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:08.340
And in the forest.

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:14.930
That's...

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:24.840
Stop!

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:28.730
This is highly indecent!

00:06:28.730 --> 00:06:30.200
No!

00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:31.240
Princess!

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:38.570
Princess! Are you all right?

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:39.370
Yeah...

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:43.000
What about me, Ash? I was
pretty scared too, you know?

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:49.760
Necromancia, at the training camp!

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:53.400
All we can do is trust the camp director.

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:55.720
Saddle up. We're storming the mausoleum!

00:06:58.220 --> 00:06:59.980
Troops, get in formation!

00:07:00.260 --> 00:07:02.730
Time to show off
the fruits of your training!

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:13.870
Here we go.

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:16.240
Commence counterattack!

00:07:22.260 --> 00:07:24.250
There's no end to them!

00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:25.710
Eco?

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:27.920
Bring out my Arch.

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:30.270
I can't help anyone like this.

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:32.780
Wh-What are you, stupid?

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:37.470
Even a fake suit of Arch would put too much strain on someone as injured as you are!

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:40.730
I know you're trying to
just grin and bear it!

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:45.100
In that case, couldn't you
make me something lighter?

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:46.060
What?

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:50.490
I bet you can make me
exactly the Arch I need now.

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:53.360
Wh-Why are <i>you</i> so confident?

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:55.160
Isn't it obvious?

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:56.950
Because I have <i>you</i> for a Pal.

00:08:00.520 --> 00:08:01.900
Oh, all right.

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:09.710
But while I'm at the Workshop,
my spirit will be detached from my body.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:13.180
I know. I'll keep your body safe.

00:08:15.380 --> 00:08:17.280
How's this?

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:21.210
M-Make sure you hold
me up properly, or else...

00:08:39.090 --> 00:08:40.330
Gawain.

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:44.490
What is it, Lancelot?

00:08:48.470 --> 00:08:51.050
We meet again, boy.

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:52.220
Milgauss!

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:56.520
I've heard about you, Milgauss!

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:58.880
In the name of the royal
knight family of Lautreamont,

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:00.970
I will rain divine retribution down on you!

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:04.640
What's so funny?!

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:07.820
Just think. It was not one of the greatest warriors alive,

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:09.820
Veronica Lautreamont,

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:13.230
but <i>you</i>, so cowardly and needy,

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:16.550
who made a pact with
a dragon in the Orphan's Rite.

00:09:16.550 --> 00:09:17.320
What?

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:20.860
My, how you've grown...

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:21.700
Silvie.

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:26.960
Hey! There you are!

00:09:28.760 --> 00:09:33.220
C'mon, brother! You should
talk to me too, not just Glen!

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:36.620
How could someone in
the royal knight family...

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:39.340
...commit the greatest taboo?

00:09:39.340 --> 00:09:42.600
He has killed a dragon.
The Dragonslayer...

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:45.050
Prince Julius!

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:57.050
Lancelot has a lot of fight in him, I see.

00:09:57.050 --> 00:10:01.200
Or are you using some kind of esoteric trick again, boy?

00:10:01.520 --> 00:10:02.350
What?!

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:06.610
Although the Imperial Princess of Avalon can't do much in that state.

00:10:06.610 --> 00:10:09.960
Avalon... How do you know about that?

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:14.090
This Necromancia here
is no mere juvenile.

00:10:14.690 --> 00:10:16.760
He lived as a Maestro.

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:19.590
You Knight Country people are familiar with it, I believe.

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:25.600
The sad tale of the dragon who loved
his master so much that he chose death.

00:10:25.870 --> 00:10:29.020
That's right. His name was Nuada,

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:32.890
the sacred dragon of Willingham.

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:50.820
I see.

00:10:50.820 --> 00:10:53.560
You want to make some Arch,
but you don't have time,

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:55.630
so you want to sample my work...

00:10:56.160 --> 00:10:58.640
and remix it.

00:10:58.640 --> 00:11:03.390
Yep. Much as I'm loath to admit it,
you <i>do</i> seem to know more than me.

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:08.320
Of course. You and I are
two sides of the same coin.

00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:11.270
I don't mind helping. However...

00:11:13.090 --> 00:11:15.160
You must promise me one thing.

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:15.770
What?

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:21.530
That one day, you'll present the
finest original Arch to Ash Blake.

00:11:21.970 --> 00:11:22.810
Wha...

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:25.740
Y-You mean...

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:28.140
Yes. For dragonkind, it's like saying,

00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:31.250
"I offer myself to you, body and soul."

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:34.280
B-But I...

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:35.000
You can't?

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:41.380
Fine. I promise.

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:55.080
Almete, gorjal, peto,
espaldar, brafonera, falda...

00:11:56.570 --> 00:11:57.440
What is it?

00:11:57.440 --> 00:12:01.100
He's got himself into
a pretty sticky situation.

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:02.400
Can you hurry it up?

00:12:03.760 --> 00:12:05.310
I suppose I'd better.

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:19.380
Wha...

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:30.600
S-Stay away! S-Stop it!

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:35.400
Please!

00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:38.230
Stop it!

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:40.900
Not there!

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:43.980
H-How dare you!

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:46.160
I'm a daughter of the Valentine fami— No!

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:48.940
S-Stop right there!

00:12:48.940 --> 00:12:50.790
Not even Sir Ash has gone that far!

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:57.140
Thank you for saving me, Rhiannon!

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:13.830
They're not letting up.

00:13:14.420 --> 00:13:16.690
<i>We've got to break through somehow.</i>

00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:25.250
There's <i>more</i>?

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:29.200
Princess!

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:33.710
Stay your hand! I will pacify Nuada's spirit!

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:37.510
No! Don't touch me there!

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:41.710
Stop! No!

00:13:42.110 --> 00:13:43.710
No!

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:44.970
Lucca!

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:48.350
Eco!

00:13:51.410 --> 00:14:07.360
Eco...

00:14:10.270 --> 00:14:12.870
Eco!

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:20.910
Wh-What the...

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:22.860
What's going on here?

00:14:27.940 --> 00:14:29.090
Eco.

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:34.170
Honestly! What would
you do without me?

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:37.050
Espolazo!

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:47.430
Is this... Arch light?

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:50.240
That's the daughter of Avalon for you.

00:15:03.840 --> 00:15:05.840
Are you sure you don't
want to take on Nuada?

00:15:07.110 --> 00:15:09.590
The princess said to stay out of it.

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:11.340
Calm yourself...

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:12.850
Nuada!

00:15:14.610 --> 00:15:17.150
So you're not the real thing after all.

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:20.910
Ash!

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:26.960
That Arch is made for defense,
so lay off the kicking and punching!

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:28.610
Hurry up and make with the magic!

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:29.860
Got it!

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:34.700
Manifest now, O ye impregnable shield.

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:36.530
It's name: Aegis!

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:37.870
Go!

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:48.570
Petrification magic!

00:15:48.570 --> 00:15:50.760
I was sure that had been
outlawed in Knight Country.

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:06.780
Well?

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:08.780
Come on now, boy.

00:16:13.310 --> 00:16:15.530
Then I guess I'll have to come to you!

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:23.790
Milgauss!

00:16:29.560 --> 00:16:31.370
Ash Blake!

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:33.690
Stop right there!

00:16:34.790 --> 00:16:37.050
Nuada's spirit has returned to the heavens!

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:42.060
Accept your fate!

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:51.190
Surprised?

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:53.200
The left one was false.

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:59.330
That aside, it seems I must revise
my opinion of the fourth princess.

00:17:04.990 --> 00:17:06.210
Wait!

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:14.460
Look at them all.

00:17:23.190 --> 00:17:24.230
Lancelot!

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:26.440
<i>Dammit.</i>

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:29.110
<i>We're in no position
to go help them either.</i>

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:31.610
Lucca?

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:34.610
Lancelot and Silvia...

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:36.900
and you and Eco.

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:38.620
You all fought so hard.

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:44.370
Who alone among us hasn't? Who?

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:55.800
Ash!

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:57.980
Lucca?!

00:17:57.980 --> 00:18:02.800
You risked your life for Gawain and me.

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:07.060
When I'm with you, I feel like
I can give it my all.

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:09.510
I want to help them.

00:18:09.510 --> 00:18:11.570
No, I <i>will</i> help them.

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:15.280
You can do it. I'm with you.

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:19.360
<i>I'm sorry, Gawain.</i>

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:22.410
<i>I won't be afraid of you anymore.</i>

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:25.930
<i>So please, take me back, Gawain.</i>

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:31.260
Here, Gawain, have some.

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:33.420
Tap into my astral flow.

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:35.910
Drink me in.

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:38.430
After all...

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:41.080
you are...

00:18:42.440 --> 00:18:43.560
my Pal!

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:52.250
Caring for the injured
is our top priority!

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:55.190
We need tight coordination. Don't rush out into the fray!

00:18:59.930 --> 00:19:01.910
<i>There are just too many of them.</i>

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:05.240
<i>I think we might be done for.</i>

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:07.040
Wh-What's that?!

00:19:08.020 --> 00:19:10.830
Not another Necromancia!

00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:13.000
<i>No, not this one.</i>

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:13.840
That's...

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:19.050
Lucca!

00:19:19.520 --> 00:19:23.430
Grab on tight so
you won't get flung off.

00:19:38.460 --> 00:19:39.820
He's so fast!

00:19:52.390 --> 00:19:55.960
You can do it, Lucca. I'm with you.

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:18.860
Dragon Dance, First Movement.

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:22.490
Cleansing Amrita!

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:43.310
The Necromancia...

00:20:43.310 --> 00:20:44.800
They're fading away!

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:49.080
Lucca.

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:50.020
Lucca!

00:20:58.410 --> 00:21:01.870
You finally pulled it off, Lucca.

00:21:04.020 --> 00:21:08.620
Since ancient times,
the Ecbladian Dragonars

00:21:09.140 --> 00:21:11.480
have been known as "elfin dancers,"

00:21:14.110 --> 00:21:17.110
and now Lucca has shown us why.

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:28.680
I see.

00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:31.720
But now we know the extent
of their military power.

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:37.360
As a result of this incident, we alone have the technique for calling Necromancia back.

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:40.570
So it's not a total loss, then.

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:44.240
I will crush them both:

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:47.420
Lautreamont Knight Country <i>and</i> the Chevron Kingdom.

00:21:47.420 --> 00:21:49.370
My ambition demands it.

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:52.800
Just wait until the Continental Congress.

00:21:54.800 --> 00:21:56.330
Cheers!

00:21:56.860 --> 00:21:59.120
Congratulations on
leaving the hospital, Ash!

00:22:00.440 --> 00:22:01.340
Thanks.

00:22:01.640 --> 00:22:04.220
All Student Council members
are safe and sound,

00:22:04.220 --> 00:22:07.790
and Professor Angela was found in the mausoleum, unhurt.

00:22:07.790 --> 00:22:10.700
So all's well that ends well.

00:22:12.690 --> 00:22:14.750
Express delivery!

00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:19.850
First-rank postal courier
Orletta Blanc here!

00:22:19.850 --> 00:22:24.360
I bring a missive for Her Highness Princess Silvia from the Paladin!

00:22:25.440 --> 00:22:27.710
From Father? For me?

00:22:30.560 --> 00:22:32.460
What does it say?

00:22:32.460 --> 00:22:36.640
He wants me to attend Elysion,
the Continental Congress.

00:22:36.640 --> 00:22:37.870
The Continental Congress?

00:22:38.280 --> 00:22:43.630
And he'd like to meet you and Eco.
I'm to bring you with me.

00:22:45.990 --> 00:22:46.920
What?

00:24:28.400 --> 00:24:29.130
<i>What</i> is?

00:24:29.130 --> 00:24:32.410
I'm sure your thing can satisfy any girl around.
